s/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-03-04T19:44:06Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T00:43:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.4.0 stable\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu 22.04 Godot 4.4.0 Stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nQuick Load cuts off filenames too soon, making it slower to load a file.\n\nIn 4.3 the Quick Load showed more of the file names, making it fast to find a file.  Because it's now more user interaction to find a file, this should be considered a regression. It is supposed to be a \"Quick\" interaction.\n\nThis is solved using List View, however that is another interaction, navigate to tiny button with mouse + click. I already did that for Quick Load\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c5543cc-dca8-405f-b9cb-8fc7fb3c78a8)\n\nAdding List View as a default preference to Editor Settings can solve this.\n\nWhile this could have been a proposal, because it regresses the Quick Load behavior, an issue is more suited?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUse a Quick Load feature and try to find similar file names\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c23f3355-9f34-4d32-90b1-2dacc085e674)\n\nAs you can see in this example, it's not possible to see the difference in some of these files without further interaction\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot needed","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103593/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103593/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}